  "meta": {
    "status": "live",
    "notes": "IA 136 remains the faster direct line. The 420th Avenue–180th Street detour is longer and partly unpaved in OSM. Dirt is a game adaptation of unpaved tags, not a surveyed gravel claim; the bridge surface is unspecified in the source. Lane widths, verges and race stunt features are arcade adaptations. No private-property, named-landmark or current motorcycle-access claim. The shoulder stunt carrier is fictional race equipment on the paved approach, not a mapped roadside attraction; both travel lanes provide a ride-around. Existing highway feature identities retain their original along-line stations through the split; the patrol marker is tightened onto the paved shoulder."
  }
